# Groundwater

Depth-to-groundwater data are available on WaterNSW (in csv format) for monitoring sites across New South Wales. This assignment focuses on analysing groundwater level changes and calculating effective porosity using a combination of satellite gravity data and satellite soil moisture data.

**Total: 15 marks.**

### Data Access Instructions

Depth-to-groundwater data are available from the WaterNSW realtime [data website](https://realtimedata.waternsw.com.au/water.stm).

**Data retrieval steps:**
- In the "Groundwater (Telemetered data)" section on the left, select "Search".
- Enter the site code in .ref {table-1}, then search for the data.
- Choose "download" found in the "Output" options. Select the sampling interval that you require.

